cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this project, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "M2-BLIPI Composites: composite metabolic scores for risk stratification in Burkitt lymphoma"
abstract: >-
  A study within the M2-BLIPI research program testing whether literature-derived
  composite metabolic scores, inferred from transcriptomic data, carry prognostic
  information in Burkitt lymphoma beyond established clinical prognostic tools.
  Code and data will be released on publication.
type: software
